And therein lies the problem. *Cursing* always involves a component of
emotional manipulation, which is not a component of lojban. You can make
statements which you can determine are either valid, or invalid, and
whether or not you choose to imbue them with emotional content is entirely
up to you, not a function of the language. What to you is a logical curse?

mi'e brais

